==Dungeon denizens==
The Library, the right-most entrance, consists of four sections: the [[Huntsman's Cloister]], with [[Scarlet Beastmaster]]s and the boss [[Houndmaster Loksey]]; the [[Gallery of Treasures]]; the [[Sanctum of the Fist]] and the boss [[Brother Wystan]]; and the [[Athenaeum (Scarlet Monastery)|Athenaeum]] with the boss [[Arcanist Doan]].   
